OL,3,ABBC travels inside occupied Lebanon as
OL,4,Aofficials say Israel expanding
OL,5,Apositions
OL,6,
OL,7,FNear the town of Naqoura, a Lebanese
OL,8,Fmilitary checkpoint, painted in the
OL,9,Fwhite-and-red colours of the national
OL,10,Fflag, is the last visible sign of the
OL,11,Fstate's presence. Soldiers are
OL,12,Fpositioned behind concrete walls, but
OL,13,Fthe road is empty. A few minutes
OL,14,Ffurther south, around a dozen Israeli
OL,15,Fflags indicate the start of occupied
OL,16,Fterritory. Unless authorised by Israel,
OL,17,Fno-one can enter.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
