OL,3,ABBC travels inside occupied Lebanon as
OL,4,Aofficials say Israel expanding
OL,5,Apositions
OL,6,
OL,7,FThis part of the country is the
OL,8,Fheartland of Lebanon's Shia Muslim
OL,9,Fcommunity, from which Hezbollah, the
OL,10,FIranian-backed militia and political
OL,11,Fparty, gets most of its support. It has
OL,12,Fseen three invasions by the Israeli
OL,13,Fmilitary in wars against the group in
OL,14,Fthe last two decades alone. The most
OL,15,Frecent started in March, after
OL,16,FHezbollah fired rockets into Israel
OL,17,Ffollowing the killing of the Iranian
OL,18,Fsupreme leader, at the start of the US
OL,19,Fand Israel's war against Iran.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG3/4
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
